{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "素材外流是大忌  (Leaking Footage Is Strictly Forbidden)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Leaving Xingtian late at night, Chun Yuqiao spots Bu Xiaogu struggling with a heavy bag of Unit Two's raw-footage hard drives and stops her at the door. Listen to their tense conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你袋子里装的是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "二部的素材硬盘坏了，让我拿出去修，说是您要用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拍摄素材外流是大忌，公司的硬盘从来没有拿出去修过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "内部的技术人员如果修不好，宁可销毁，这是常识。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在赶紧拿回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一出门，现在你已经是贼了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有证据吗？他们没有通过系统下命令，没有留下任何证据。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在给他们打电话，把他们叫出来当面对质。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后您出来帮我作证吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "自己的事情自己解决，你应该知道怎么跟制作人配合。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你袋子里装的是什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you carrying in your bag?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "二部的素材硬盘坏了，让我拿出去修，说是您要用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit Two's footage drives broke; they told me to get them fixed outside for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拍摄素材外流是大忌，公司的硬盘从来没有拿出去修过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leaking raw footage is strictly taboo; company drives are never repaired outside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "内部的技术人员如果修不好，宁可销毁，这是常识。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If in-house technicians cannot fix a drive, we destroy it instead; that is common sense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在赶紧拿回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then let me hurry and take them right back inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一出门，现在你已经是贼了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The moment you stepped out the door, you already looked like a thief.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有证据吗？他们没有通过系统下命令，没有留下任何证据。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have proof? They issued no order in the system and left zero evidence.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在给他们打电话，把他们叫出来当面对质。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Call them right now and bring them outside to confront them face to face.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后您出来帮我作证吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And then you will step out to testify for me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "自己的事情自己解决，你应该知道怎么跟制作人配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Settle your own problems yourself; you know how a host works with a producer.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你袋子里装的是什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "二部的素材硬盘坏了，让我拿出去修，说是您要用。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "拍摄素材外流是大忌，公司的硬盘从来没有拿出去修过。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "内部的技术人员如果修不好，宁可销毁，这是常识。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我现在赶紧拿回去吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一出门，现在你已经是贼了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有证据吗？他们没有通过系统下命令，没有留下任何证据。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在给他们打电话，把他们叫出来当面对质。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "然后您出来帮我作证吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "自己的事情自己解决，你应该知道怎么跟制作人配合。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Instead of shielding Xiaogu from afar, Yuqiao teaches her to call the schemers outside and settle the trap face to face. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
